:: OC Bobby Intro 2 Bus [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 10>>
<<set $Money -= 5>>
The bus ride itself takes a decent few minutes, especially with quite a few stops between where you got on and the farms, leaving you one of the few people still on the bus once it starts to head in that direction. But as you see just how far the farms are and watch out the windows as the residential houses and shops soon give way to long stretches of empty fields, lone houses on range, and impressively maintained farmlands, <span style="color:LightGreen">you are thankful that you decided to take the bus rather than walk.</span> <br>
<br>
The bus drops you off along a nearly deserted road with a few farms nearby. You have to ask the bus driver if he knows the direction of the specific one you are looking for and he is thankfully able to point you towards it. It takes a few more minutes of walking, but eventually you see the <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thompson’s Farm”</span> sign out front and happily begin to walk up the dirt road. Approaching the large farmhouse, you spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> out front moving some boxes. He smiles upon seeing you and runs over. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well know, wasn’t sure you were going to make it. Great to see you!”</span> He laughs, patting you on the head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright then, let me give you the grand tour!”</span> <br>
