:: OC Bobby Intro 2 Fields [nobr]

You walk over to one of the large vegetable patches and are given your instructions. A bunch of weeds have been growing here recently, so you need to walk along the field and pull any you see. Busy, tedious work, but simple enough. You are given thick gloves to aid in the process. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you could also check to see if any of the plants are in a bad way, that’d be great. Hard to know which ones of them need the extra attention when we get this busy.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> adds. <br>
<br>
Starting on one corner, you perform a zig-zag pattern to ensure you don’t miss any weeds or wilting plants, you’d hate to disappoint <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> on such a simple task. Pulling the weeds is hard work, as some of them have deep roots and you are careful not to damage or disturb the other plants. But when you’ve finished, you’ve cleaned the place out and have an impressive pile of weeds. You’ve even made some mental notes about which plants looked to be in need of extra help. <span style="color:LightGreen">In the end, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> is very impressed with your work and gives you a praise-filled pat on your head as he walks you back to the house for some refreshments after a job well done.</span> <br>
<br>
<<include"OC Bobby Intro 3">>

:: OC Bobby Intro 2 Barn [nobr]

Walking over to the barn, you are tasked with helping <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> milk some cows, which you are a little nervous about. Thankfully, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> helps you through it and shows you the best way to calm a cow before starting it and how to attach the milking machine. You are a bit impressed about how automated it all is now. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, pops got these fancy machines to make things faster. I grew up doing it by hand, and still do to some of our more nervous girls, but this definitely makes things faster.”</span> He says as you pick up one of the sucking machines and blush. <span style="color:Pink">The shape and size of it makes you instantly wonder what it would feel like to attach this to your penis, forcibly milked by some machine. The thought makes your bits tingle, so you quickly hand the milker to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> to attach and turn away slightly embarrassed.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> seems to notice and chuckles. <br>
<br>
While the machines do most of the actual milking, you still have to haul the milk around once it’s collected and your hands are utterly exhausted by the end of it. Thankfully, you are done before too long and are actually proud of the work you managed to get done. In the end, <span style="color:LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> is very impressed with your work and gives you a praise-filled pat on your head as he walks you back to the house for some refreshments after a job well done.</span> <br>
<br>
<<include"OC Bobby Intro 3">>
